9,"Tharu, Dangaura Language (THL) – L1 & L2 Speakers, Status, Map, Endangered Level & Official Use | Ethnologue Free",https://www.ethnologue.com/language/thl/,Dangaura Tharu is a stable indigenous language of Nepal and India. It belongs to the Indo-European language family. The language is used as a first language by all in the ethnic community. It is not known to be taught in schools.,"Tharu, Dangaura",Indo-European
